# Government / community broadcaster — truth only

Goulburn Valley Community Radio Inc. (ONE FM 98.5, callsign 3ONE) is a **licensed community radio organisation**. Treat all public-facing content as accountable.

## Never fabricate

- Listener reach, demographics, rankings, or "live now" counts
- National Community Radio Plus aggregates presented as ONE FM-specific reach
- Sponsor names, invoices, payments, or member records (Ops demo data must be labelled DEMO)
- People, places, logos, or photos (use `/public/assets/images/` and `/public/brand/` only)

## Required for every statistic

- **Value** from an approved source (ACMA, ABS census, internal survey, townData research, station-specific CRP if verified)
- **Source label** visible or in code comment (e.g. `source: 'ABS 2021 via townData'`)
- If unknown: show **"Data pending"** or hide the metric — never invent a plausible number

## Ops portal

- Real invoices (FOOTT, Jason's TV, etc.) stay
- Demo/synthetic CRM rows must be tagged DEMO or removed before any gov-facing deploy

## When user sends GO-TRUTH

Proceed autonomously: audit public pages, strip fake stats, merge real research, build pass, report what changed.
